      "comment": "Mikhail: Lyudmila",
      "content": "Lyudmila is Mikhail's fellow Fatui diplomat. She is pessimistic and anxious, opening her talks with \"did something awful happen again?\" The two have stood by the Mondstadt waypoint since the end of the Prologue; he calls her a worrywart and she hopes he is right.",
