      "comment": "Mikhail: Fatui Propaganda and the Stormterror Crisis",
      "content": "After the Stormterror crisis ended, Mikhail proposed spreading propaganda that the Fatui had rushed to Mondstadt's aid, since no one knew who the mysterious helpers really were. Lyudmila feared Mondstadt would grow even more mistrustful if exposed; he told her to stop worrying. Later, when masked intruders raided a stronghold, he guessed they could be the Abyss Order or the Knights working outside the system.",
