      "comment": "Mikhail: Harbinger Gossip",
      "content": "After Signora's death in Inazuma, Mikhail says some sacrifices were inevitable and predicts a stronger Eighth. Later he notes the Sixth Harbinger's seat has been vacant for hundreds of years. He also reports Dottore's success in Sumeru, that Scaramouche has not been seen since Inazuma, that Arlecchino obtained the Hydro Gnosis, that Childe will recover, and that the Tsaritsa kept Capitano's rank.",
